###
# 09a — B 第一份五題型回覆
# 前置：前案達到預期後順序執行；細節見 Markdown 同編號
# 預期：201 Receipt；排序／trim後Text=Old；五Answers；保存oldResponseId／submittedAt
# @no-cookie-jar
POST {{apiBase}}/api/v1/forms/{{mainFormId}}/responses HTTP/1.1
Cookie: access_token={{bToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "answers": [
    {
      "questionId": "{{qRating}}",
      "value": 1
    },
    {
      "questionId": "{{qMultiple}}",
      "value": [
        "{{mTwo}}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "questionId": "{{qSingle}}",
      "value": "{{sYes}}"
    },
    {
      "questionId": "{{qNumber}}",
      "value": 9
    },
    {
      "questionId": "{{qText}}",
      "value": " Old "
    }
  ]
}

###
# 09b — B 最新整份略過 optional Text
# 前置：09a成功後等待至少1秒；不改DB時間；時間未嚴格較新則停止依賴並記FAIL
# 預期：201 新Receipt；只有四Answers；submittedAt嚴格晚於09a；保存latestResponseId
